### Estado de la API
GET http://localhost:8080/api/estado
Accept: application/json

### Crear responsable
POST http://localhost:8080/api/responsables
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nombre": "Ana",
  "apellido": "Pérez",
  "tipoDocumento": "CC",
  "numeroDocumento": "1234567890",
  "telefono": "3001234567",
  "correo": "ana@example.com"
}

### Listar responsables
GET http://localhost:8080/api/responsables
Accept: application/json

### Obtener responsable por id
GET http://localhost:8080/api/responsables/1
Accept: application/json

### Reemplazar responsable
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/responsables/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nombre": "Ana",
  "apellido": "Pérez Gómez",
  "tipoDocumento": "CC",
  "numeroDocumento": "1234567890",
  "telefono": "3001234567",
  "correo": "ana@example.com"
}

### Eliminar responsable
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/responsables/1
